                     void *callback_data);
    ```
5. `lha_decoder_monitor`
    Registers a progress callback for `LHADecoder`. Call it before/while decoding to receive progress updates via `callback_data`. It scales `block_size` up for very large streams so reported blocks stay ≤128K and avoid 32-bit overflow, then triggers an initial progress check. Its signature is:
