5. `lha_decoder_read`
​ `lha_decoder_read` copies up to `buf_len` decompressed bytes into `buf`. It’s meant for incremental reads from an `LHADecoder`. It truncates at `stream_length` to avoid extra bytes at EOF, and may return fewer bytes than requested when data runs out.
