​ ```
4. `lha_reader_new`
​ Creates a new `LHAReader` for reading an LHA archive from an `LHAInputStream`. Use it with a valid stream; it allocates the reader and initializes state. Returns `NULL` on allocation failure or if the underlying basic reader can’t be created.
